#lem: niŋ[thing]; šu[hand]; dug[speak]; ki[place]; diŋir[deity]; til[complete]
#etcsl: line-id=B.4.52.24

@end proverb

@div proverb 4.53

B.4.53.25. ama er₂ še₈-še₈ X X X HAR-ra bi₂-ib₂-gu₇-en
#lem: ama[mother]; er[tears]; šeš[weep]; X; X; X; X; gu[eat]
