#etcsl: line-id=B.4.54.27

@end proverb

@div proverb 4.55

B.4.55.28. ziₓ(IGI@g)-a a sig₉-sig₉ bi₂-in#-[...]
#lem: ziʾa[blinded worker]; a[water]; sig[clear]; X
