#lem: lu[person]; ur[roof]; lu[person]; e[house]; til[live (of a single person)]
#tr.en: @note{cf. @xref[t.6.1.02,t.6.1.02.126]{6.1.02.126}, @xref[t.6.1.11,t.6.1.11.131]{6.1.11.131}} Says the man lying on the roof to the man living in the house: 
